        "id": 1004300
      },
      "writtenOn": "2010-10-05T08:57:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "EONS enables the operator to control the operator name display. Some operators want their name to be displayed even in Roaming.\nIdeally they should do it using OPL/PNN but this can also be done using CPHS_ONS files. Ideally these files are not programmed, if programmed we use it as EONS in case of no match from OPL/PNN files.\nI will remove this if not required. Some OEMS requested this support as part of EONS. Please suggest.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAA73///34\u003d",
      "revId": "fff5d2bdddc337e0343b8daba8c8a6c1c79be319",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
