      "writtenOn": "2010-10-05T08:57:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is to notify the registrants of certain events like\n1) OPL/PNN records refreshed over the Air. (EVENT_EONS)\n    This should trigger EONS, update SS with the new operator and should update the operator name display as well. \n2) EF_SPN updated(EVENT_SPN). This should just update the display to reflect the new SPN name. Actually this can be done from SIMRecords.java file itself by making the updateSpnDisplay public and calling it directly using phone object like this \nphone.mSST.updateSpnDisplay() but again as said earlier we do not want the SIMRecords code to depend on phone object.\n\nAs you suggested the name can be changed to reflect the functionality  like registerForSIMEFUpdates(), i will change to any suggested name if this does not reflect the functionality.",
