      },
      "writtenOn": "2010-10-04T19:11:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be called much earlier in the method.  Since it modifies ss, it can affect hasChanged.  (And if you move it up that far, then it should be acting on newSS instead of ss - so maybe take ss as an arg.)",
      "revId": "fff5d2bdddc337e0343b8daba8c8a6c1c79be319",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
