      "side": 1,
      "message": "Very valid scenario. Please suggest on how to handle this. My opinion is to move updateEons() to the start of this function and update newSS in place of SS.\n\nHow does passing SS as parameter can solve this? SS will any way be over written by newSS (if move to top) and the updated name is lost. Please let me know if i missed any thing in that comment.",
