        "id": 1000718
      },
      "writtenOn": "2010-10-04T19:11:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These file loads need to be cleaned up.  EF_PNN is accessed above, and then again below.  These should be combined.  SPN files are (potentially) loaded in getSpnFsm().  We should combine these as well (avoid loading the same file multiple times).",
      "revId": "fff5d2bdddc337e0343b8daba8c8a6c1c79be319",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
