    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "AAAA73///ww\u003d",
        "filename": "telephony/java/com/android/internal/telephony/gsm/SIMRecords.java",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 1394,
      "author": {
        "id": 1004300
      },
      "writtenOn": "2010-10-05T08:57:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes clean up is required here but need your suggestions on this and this itself will be significant change. Hence i did not combine that will EONS to concentrate more on that.\nThese are the decisions to be taken.\n1) Presently only the first records of PNN is read and mPnnHome.. parameter is updated. For EONS we read all the records of PNN and cache them. Do you want me to remove the existing PNN first record read and derive that from PNN cache itself?\n2) getSpnFsm() conditionally reads EF_CPHS_ONS and EF_CPHS_ONS_SHORT. Do you want me to change the code of getSpnFsm() to use the already read data of EF_CPHS_ONS and EF_CPHS_SHORT_ONS as part of fetchsimrecords()?\nAnd any way if it is decided not to use CPHS_ONS files for EONS, these changes are not required.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAA73///38\u003d",
      "revId": "fff5d2bdddc337e0343b8daba8c8a6c1c79be319",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
